@page "/about"
<h1>About</h1>
<p>
The Usual Wheel is a personal movie night app built for two friends who spin a wheel of movies starring a specific actor, take smoke breaks, and watch whatever the wheel lands on. Starting with Russell Crowe, the app helps track movie selections, break times, and recaps, making each movie night unique and memorable. Built with .NET MAUI Blazor Hybrid, it combines web tech and native features for a seamless experience on Android and iOS.
</p>